# Sprint 2 Backlog

## Sprint Goal

The goal of this sprint is to begin creating the basic structure of the Digital Baby Book application.

## Planned Tasks

* Create a basic home page for the application.
* Add a main menu with options for milestones, photos, videos, and family members.
* Organize the project files in the GitHub repository.
* Update the README file with the current project progress.
* Review the design and identify improvements for the next sprint.

## Definition of Done

This sprint will be complete when the basic home page and main menu have been added to the repository and the project documentation has been updated.
